    <item>
      <title>Swap places</title>
      <link>https://merak.run/blog/swaps/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Nov 2021 00:37:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://merak.run/blog/swaps/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes we want to exchange tokens between them, and many times the easiest way is to use a Swap page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those pages connect to your wallet, like &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/m/metamask/&#34;&gt;Metamask&lt;/a&gt;, and ask for &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/blog/tokenapprovals/&#34;&gt;approval&lt;/a&gt; for interacting with your tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With those interactions will allow you to select the tokens to use as source (funds) and target from a list, or via their &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/c/contract/&#34;&gt;contract&lt;/a&gt; so that you can exchange them.&lt;/p&gt;
